description = "Replaces the Reclaimer's welder. High-explosive rounds on a steep arc, over walls and down behind them, at anything your squad can see — the Reclaimer never needs its own line of sight. Too slow to catch a runner; murder on anyone holding a position. Won't fire danger-close to your own. It still grinds wrecks. It no longer repairs."
